      "fileName": "ardent-armiger.json",
      "id": "iKOcwFCbNX1a2OFT",
      "name": "Ardent Armiger",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "iKOcwFCbNX1a2OFT",
        "folder": "zAcAs2H0PmkyszwK",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Ardent Armiger",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You've trained to resist the manipulations of fiends, and your Hellknight discipline makes you difficult to influence. You gain a +1 circumstance bonus to saves against effects that could inflict the controlled or frightened conditions.</p>\n<p>If a mental effect would compel you to act in a way that violates your Hellknight order's tenets (as determined by the GM), you can attempt to break free from the effect as a free action triggered by receiving the violating order, and you gain a new Will save against the effect. You can attempt this save even if the effect would normally prevent you from acting of your own volition. You can attempt this new save only once for a given effect, even if you're compelled to violate your order's tenets multiple times. You can't receive a worse result on this Will save than you originally got against the compelling mental effect.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 4
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "Hellknight Dedication"
              }
            ]
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Lost Omens Hellfire Dispatches"
          },
          "rules": [
            {
              "key": "ActiveEffectLike",
              "mode": "add",
              "path": "flags.system.hellknightArchetype.featCount",
              "value": 1
            },
            {
              "key": "FlatModifier",
              "predicate": [
                {
                  "or": [
                    "inflicts:controlled",
                    "inflicts:frightened"
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "selector": [
                "saving-throw"
              ],
              "type": "circumstance",
              "value": 1
            }
          ],
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
            "value": [
              "archetype"
            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "feat"
      },
      "level": 4,
      "category": "class"
    },
    {
      "fileName": "armigers-protection.json",
      "id": "h1TgAE6YeoiJnmex",
      "name": "Armiger's Protection",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "h1TgAE6YeoiJnmex",
        "folder": "zAcAs2H0PmkyszwK",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Armiger's Protection",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You've learned to wear the iconic Hellknight armor. You become trained in light armor and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Hellknight Breastplate], a medium armor. If you were already trained in light armor and medium armor, you gain training in @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Hellknight Half Plate] and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Hellknight Plate]. Whenever you gain a class feature that grants you expert or greater proficiency in any type of armor (but not unarmored defense), you also gain that proficiency in the armor types granted to you by this feat. If you have a class feature that grants you expert proficiency in unarmored defense and you're 13th level or higher, you also become an expert in the armor types granted to you by this feat.</p>\n<p>In addition, when you choose this feat, you receive a non-magical suit of Hellknight armor of a type you become trained in (@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Hellknight Breastplate], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Hellknight Half Plate], or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Hellknight Plate]).</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 4
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "Hellknight Dedication"
              }
            ]
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Lost Omens Hellfire Dispatches"
          },
          "rules": [
            {
              "key": "ActiveEffectLike",
              "mode": "add",
              "path": "flags.system.hellknightArchetype.featCount",
              "value": 1
            },
            {
